    "bodyOriginal": "Canada’s top liquor brand looks on track for a reprieve because it’s bottled in the U.S. for American customers.",
    "bodyJa": "カナダのトップ酒類ブランドは、米国の顧客向けに米国で瓶詰めされているため、猶予の見通しとなっている。",
    "source": "MarketWatch",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/canadian-whisky-on-the-rocks-crown-royal-is-set-to-avoid-trumps-new-ban-2953bea3?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T19:40:00+00:00",
