    "source": "MarketWatch",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/investors-worried-about-rising-bond-yields-are-keeping-a-close-eye-on-this-corner-of-the-market-aa4096c8?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T16:09:00+00:00",
